stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> New: router sends NewOrder (audit cause Sent)
  New --> Acknowledged: ER New
  New --> PartiallyFilled: ER fill, cum below ordered
  New --> Filled: ER fill, cum equals ordered
  New --> Rejected: ER Rejected
  New --> CancelRequested: no ack or IOC report in time, kill, deadline
  New --> Cancelled: ER Cancelled (IOC remainder)
  Acknowledged --> PartiallyFilled: ER fill
  Acknowledged --> Filled: ER fill, cum equals ordered
  Acknowledged --> Rejected: ER Rejected
  Acknowledged --> CancelRequested: cancel sent
  Acknowledged --> Cancelled: ER Cancelled
  PartiallyFilled --> PartiallyFilled: ER fill
  PartiallyFilled --> Filled: ER fill, cum equals ordered
  PartiallyFilled --> CancelRequested: cancel sent
  PartiallyFilled --> Cancelled: ER Cancelled
  CancelRequested --> CancelRequested: ER fill that raced the cancel, or cancel sent again after cancelNanos
  CancelRequested --> Filled: ER fill, cum equals ordered
  CancelRequested --> Cancelled: ER Cancelled, plain cancel
  CancelRequested --> Replaced: ER Cancelled, quantity to be re-routed
  CancelRequested --> Rejected: ER Rejected crossed the cancel
  CancelRequested --> New: OrderCancelReject (45), was New, nothing filled
  CancelRequested --> Acknowledged: OrderCancelReject (45), was Acknowledged, nothing filled
  CancelRequested --> PartiallyFilled: OrderCancelReject (45), some filled
  Cancelled --> Cancelled: late fill up to the venue's reported cum
  Replaced --> Replaced: late fill up to the venue's reported cum
  Cancelled --> Filled: late fills reach ordered
  Replaced --> Filled: late fills reach ordered
  Filled --> Released: leaves zero
  Cancelled --> Released: leaves zero
  Replaced --> Released: leaves zero
  Rejected --> Released: leaves zero
  Released --> [*]
  note right of CancelRequested
    After a refused cancel: one more cancelNanos wait, then cancel
    again. After maxCancelAttempts without an answer the child is
    flagged unresolved: not a state, its quantity stays reserved and
    the parent ends Failed. An order absent from a mass status is
    sent a cancel, not freed (DR-RV-R04).
  end note
  note right of Released
    The slot is free and the book no longer knows the order.
    A fill reported now is booked by DeskGroup as a position, once
    by venue and execId (lateFills, DR-V12-D13).
  end note
